  "verdict": "Perf and error conditions of nopub2_rule all hold: S1 P2 send p50 0.575x / p90 0.619x (p99 0.538x); E1 P2 errors 3 vs 5, P6 1 vs 1; E2 zero visibility-signature errors (every error payload in both arms is RESOURCE_BUSY / busy_retryable); G1 P6 p50 0.816x / p90 0.468x (p99 0.160x); G2 fetch 1.007x / 1.000x; G3 WAL peak median 0.99x / 0.97x. Correctness: C1, C2 and C3 all pass. WIN under nopub2_rule. NOT landed: per the rule this changes the cross-process publication contract, so the result goes to the owner before landing.",
